#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**S gate**\n"
msgstr "**Bramka S**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The S gate applies a phase of $i$ to the $\\left|1\\right\\rangle$ state. It"
" is equivalent to RZ for the angle $\\pi/2$. Note that S=P($\\pi/2$).\n"
msgstr ""
"Bramka S stosuje fazę $i$ do stanu $\\left|1\\right\\rangle$. Jest "
"równoważna RZ dla kąta $\\pi/2$. Zauważ, że S=P($\\pi/2$).\n"

