msgstr "W IBM Quantum Composer domyślna wartość `theta` wynosi $\\pi/2$.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**RZ gate**\n"
msgstr "**Bramka RZ**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The RZ gate implements $exp(-i\\frac{\\theta}{2}Z)$. On the Bloch sphere, "
"this gate corresponds to rotating the qubit state around the z axis by the "
"given angle.\n"
msgstr ""
"Bramka RZ implementuje $exp(-i\\frac{\\theta}{2}Z)$. Na sferze Blocha bramka"
" ta odpowiada obrotowi stanu kubitu wokół osi z o podany kąt.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
