#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**RY gate**\n"
msgstr "**Bramka RY**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The RY gate implements $exp(-i\\frac{\\theta}{2}Y)$. On the Bloch sphere, "
"this gate corresponds to rotating the qubit state around the y axis by the "
"given angle and does not introduce complex amplitudes.\n"
msgstr ""
"Bramka RY implementuje $exp(-i\\frac{\\theta}{2}Y)$. Na sferze Blocha bramka"
" ta odpowiada obrotowi stanu kubitu wokół osi y o zadany kąt i nie wprowadza"
" zespolonych amplitud.\n"

