#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In IBM Quantum Composer, the default value for `angle` is $\\pi/2$. "
"Therefore, this is the angle used in the q-sphere visualization below.\n"
msgstr ""
"W IBM Quantum Composer domyślna wartość parametru `angle` wynosi $\\pi/2$. "
"Dlatego właśnie ten kąt jest używany w poniższej wizualizacji na sferze Q.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**RXX gate**\n"
msgstr "**Bramka RXX**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The RXX gate implements $\\exp(-i \\theta/2 X \\otimes X)$. The "
"Mølmer–Sørensen gate, the native gate on ion-trap systems, can be expressed "
"as a sum of RXX gates.\n"
msgstr ""
"Bramka RXX implementuje $\\exp(-i \\theta/2 X \\otimes X)$. Bramka "
"Mølmera–Sørensena, będąca natywną bramką w układach z pułapkami jonowymi, "
"może być wyrażona jako suma bramek RXX.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Composer reference                                 | OpenQASM reference       | Q-sphere | Note about q-sphere representations                                                                                                                                                                                                     |\n"
"| -------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
